From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maago <maago@example.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 22:16:09 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Try a model result that misses a column
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

일부러 틀려 본다. RecentPosts의 결과를 모델 Post로 두고 body를 빼먹었다.

결과가 모델이면 컬럼이 모델의 필드와 딱 맞아야 한다. 하나라도 빠지면
Scan할 곳이 비므로 maago gen은 아무것도 쓰지 않고 이렇게 알린다:

    board/queries/recent_posts.sql:4:1: result columns do not match model Post: missing "body"
      fix: select every column of Post, or declare a new result type name (e.g. ":many PostSummary")

Maago-Expect: board/queries/recent_posts.sql:4:1: result columns do not match model Post: missing "body"

diff --git a/board/queries/recent_posts.sql b/board/queries/recent_posts.sql
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5766e2e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/board/queries/recent_posts.sql
@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+-- name: RecentPosts :many Post
+-- The newest posts of every board.
+-- param: limit int64
+SELECT id, board_id, title, status, views, created_at, updated_at
+FROM board_post
+ORDER BY created_at DESC, id DESC
+LIMIT :limit
